# Compose the kit

Search `css/layouts.css` and `css/components.css` before writing a rule. Use the class that already does the job.

A `<style>` block in an HTML page is a miss when that class exists. New CSS goes in those files, and in `DESIGN.md`, only when the kit has no object for the behavior. `css/kit.css` is reference chrome, not a second component library.

A specimen may set `font-family` inline. The family is the content.

WordPress is a projection of the kit. Do not restyle kit classes in a template.
